	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Respawn",
	"Description": "Lives and respawn of a mode (M12 G3): a shared lives pool with refill, team-shared checkpoints (first touch), no revive, restart from the last checkpoint or from the level start when the pool runs out. Rules are a piece of the GameRules asset of the level or mode, so they work with a classic GameMode and with Experiences alike. GSTNRespawnCore is pure; GSTNRespawnRuntime is the server side (KO listener, respawn service, checkpoint actor, replicated state).",
